    "id": "doc_mla_project_monitoring_en",
    "page_name": "Detailed Project Monitoring & Audit Protocols",
    "feature_name": "P6-Admin",
    "description": "Administrative standard operating procedures for tracking project delays, milestones, and treasury spend.",
    "detailed_explanation": "CONFIDENTIAL ADMINISTRATIVE PROTOCOL — AUTHORIZED MLA SCOPE ONLY\n\nContains standard operating procedures for executive review of delayed GPDP works:\n1. Projects delayed by > 30 days trigger an automated administrative inquiry to the executing engineer.\n2. Payment milestone records from treasury must reconcile with on-site stage completion certificates.\n3. Inter-departmental coordination rules between PWD, KSEB, and Kerala Water Authority.\n4. Statutory penalty assessment guidelines for contractor default under Kerala Panchayati Raj Public Works Rules.",
