    "id": "doc_mla_disaster_command_en",
    "page_name": "Disaster Emergency Command Protocols",
    "feature_name": "P5-Command",
    "description": "Executive emergency checklist and administrative alert templates for river flood containment.",
    "detailed_explanation": "CONFIDENTIAL DISASTER INCIDENT COMMAND PROTOCOL — AUTHORIZED MLA SCOPE ONLY\n\nContains the 5-point executive disaster response checklist activated when Chaliyar river level breaches 9.5 meters:\n1. Convene Emergency Disaster Management Committee at Panchayat Office within 30 minutes.\n2. Deploy Ward 7 and Ward 8 rescue volunteers to coordinate high-ground evacuation.\n3. Open Thekkumpuram HSS Relief Camp with dry rations and medical first-aid.\n4. Contact KSEB to isolate inundated low-tension power cables.\n5. Initiate public broadcast advisory via community loudspeakers and SMS gateway.",
    "user_role": "president",
    "access_classification": "mla_restricted",
